---
# `role-name` rejects a hyphen in a role directory name (`^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$`). The
# hyphenated roles here (claude-code, agent-reach, multica-cli, playwright-cli, ...)
# keep the names of the tools they install, which appear in main.yml, in every
# meta/main.yml, in the docs and in the ad-hoc form
# `ansible localhost -m include_role -a name=claude-code`. The rule is skipped, not
# obeyed, so that `ansible-lint` exits 0 on a clean tree and a NEW finding is visible.
skip_list:
  - role-name
